\taxon{Remark}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{Actually, the definition of the [rational numbers](005Q) is a bit more subtle than this; the above definition does not take into account the fact that, say, #{1/2 = 2/4}.  We will see how to deal with this when we learn about [equivalence relations](008Y).}
